    "title": "Pride event becomes planned protest in Mansfield - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KSMU ,\n13 hours ago The LGBTQ+ community in Southwest, Missouri is rallying around organizers of a pride event in rural Mansfield. Organizers say public pressure, the city’s Board of Aldermen and a suspicious booking dispute caused a Pride festival on the square to be cancelled. They now plan a protest on the square... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
